{"id":"4a60f42d4d762a6d","group":"14","path":"14/14-df-enough-points.md","title":"Definition — 足够多的点","display":"Definition — 足够多的点","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Sheaves in Geometry and Logic (Mac Lane & Moerdijk)","book_abbrev":"14","label":"14-df-enough-points","aliases":["14-df-enough-points"],"display":"Definition — 足够多的点","depends_on":["[[14-df-elementary-topos]]","[[14-df-topos-point]]","[[14-df-isomorphism]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Sheaves in Geometry and Logic (Mac Lane &amp; Moerdijk)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"14"},{"key":"label","html":"14-df-enough-points"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>14-df-enough-points</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"Definition — 足够多的点"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"4e6c05c92e3b9bf9\" href=\"?note=4e6c05c92e3b9bf9\" title=\"14-df-elementary-topos\">14-df-elementary-topos</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"3cced0e71a2282b9\" href=\"?note=3cced0e71a2282b9\" title=\"14-df-topos-point\">14-df-topos-point</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"d5f547b903550705\" href=\"?note=d5f547b903550705\" title=\"14-df-isomorphism\">14-df-isomorphism</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal E\">\\(\\mathcal E\\)</span> 为初等拓扑斯；点见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"3cced0e71a2282b9\" href=\"?note=3cced0e71a2282b9\" title=\"14-df-topos-point\">14-df-topos-point</a>，点 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\">\\(p\\)</span> 的逆像取值于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf{Set}_{\\mathcal U}\">\\(\\mathbf{Set}_{\\mathcal U}\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{IsIso}_{\\mathcal E}\">\\(\\mathrm{IsIso}_{\\mathcal E}\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{IsIso}_{\\mathbf{Set}_{\\mathcal U}}\">\\(\\mathrm{IsIso}_{\\mathbf{Set}_{\\mathcal U}}\\)</span> 均采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"d5f547b903550705\" href=\"?note=d5f547b903550705\" title=\"14-df-isomorphism\">14-df-isomorphism</a>，并明确区分其环境。点数据在固定宇宙 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal V\">\\(\\mathcal V\\)</span> 中量化。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{HasEnoughPoints}(\\mathcal E)\\leftrightarrow\\forall A,B\\in\\mathrm{Ob}(\\mathcal E)\\ \\forall u\\in\\mathrm{Hom}_{\\mathcal E}(A,B)\\ \\bigl[(\\forall p\\in\\mathcal V\\ (\\mathrm{IsPoint}(p,\\mathcal E)\\to\\mathrm{IsIso}_{\\mathbf{Set}_{\\mathcal U}}(p^*(u))))\\to\\mathrm{IsIso}_{\\mathcal E}(u)\\bigr].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{HasEnoughPoints}(\\mathcal E)\\leftrightarrow\\forall A,B\\in\\mathrm{Ob}(\\mathcal E)\\ \\forall u\\in\\mathrm{Hom}_{\\mathcal E}(A,B)\\ \\bigl[(\\forall p\\in\\mathcal V\\ (\\mathrm{IsPoint}(p,\\mathcal E)\\to\\mathrm{IsIso}_{\\mathbf{Set}_{\\mathcal U}}(p^*(u))))\\to\\mathrm{IsIso}_{\\mathcal E}(u)\\bigr].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原书 IX.11 p.521 给出点联合分离箭头及等价的联合保守条件；这里采用后者。所有点的量化在 V 中，未要求其预先构成 U-集合。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"14-df-elementary-topos","status":"resolved","id":"4e6c05c92e3b9bf9","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-elementary-topos]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-topos-point","status":"resolved","id":"3cced0e71a2282b9","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-topos-point]]","embed":false},{"targe